      "raw_name": "DBClusterDescription",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Running",
      "help_en": "The cluster status. Valid values:\n\nCreating: being created.\nRunning: running.\nDeleting: being released.\nRebooting: being restarted.\nDBNodeCreating: a node is being added (increase).\nDBNodeDeleting: a node is being deleted.\nClassChanging: node specifications are being changed.\nNetAddressCreating: a network connectivity is being created.\nNetAddressDeleting: a network connectivity is being deleted.\nNetAddressModifying: a network connectivity is being modified. \nDeleted: released.\nClassChanged: resources are being revoked after a decrease the quota operation",
      "help_zh": "集群状态，取值范围如下：\n\nCreating：创建中\nRunning：运行中\nDeleting：释放中\nRebooting：重启中\nDBNodeCreating：正在增加节点\nDBNodeDeleting：正在删除节点\nClassChanging：正在变更节点规格\nNetAddressCreating：正在创建网络连接\nNetAddressDeleting：正在删除网络连接\nNetAddressModifying：正在修改网络连接 \nDeleted：已释放\nClassChanged：升降配结束资源回收中",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "db_cluster_status",
      "options": [
        "--db-cluster-status"
      ],
      "raw_name": "DBClusterStatus",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Prepaid",
      "help_en": "The billing method. Valid values: \n\nPostpaid: pay-as-you-go.\nPrepaid: subscription",
      "help_zh": "付费类型，取值范围如下： \n\nPostpaid：按量付费\nPrepaid：预付费（包年包月）",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "pay_type",
      "options": [
        "--pay-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PayType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "cn-hangzhou",
